name duel-asym-probe-1
timeout 200

# THE ASYMMETRIC DUEL, as a SMOKE TEST and nothing more. It is here to prove that the two airframes,
# their two weapon families and their two sensor suites can meet in one run without anything falling
# over — not to answer who wins. The measurement campaign is a later stage; a single geometry with a
# single loadout answers nothing about an envelope, and quoting it as if it did would be exactly the
# kind of number this tree refuses to produce.
#
# WHAT IT DOES EXERCISE, all in one tick stream:
#   - an F-16 with an AIM-120 (active radar) against a MiG-29 with an R-27R (semi-active), head-on
#   - the RCS asymmetry in both directions: the MiG's 4.0 m^2 against the F-16's 1.2 m^2 reference, so
#     the F-16 sees the MiG 1.35x further than it sees an F-16 and the MiG sees the F-16 at 0.74x its
#     own book range (fourth root of 3.33, sensors/FBRadarSystem::GateRangeM)
#   - two different fire-control computers publishing the same three DLZ numbers under two names
#   - the SARH support obligation (ttaS -1) beside the active handover (ttaS > 0) in one events.log
#   - both RWRs hearing the other's beam, and the MiG's own forward blanking while it illuminates
#
# READING RULE: any terminating exit code is a pass EXCEPT 2 (CRASH from a physics knockout that is not
# a shoot-down). What matters is that both units fly, both radars work, both weapons leave the rails and
# both are resolved. The outcome recorded on 2026-07-28 is in the report; it is a data point, not a
# result.

unit viper
  team friendly
  module f16
  spawn 46.90000 6.50000 8000 90.0 420
  set gear up
  set fuel_pct 70
  set fcr_mode acm_hud
  set fcr_range_nm 40
  set store 3 aim120
  set store 7 aim9
  set rwr on
  set cmds_mode man
  set cmds_program 1
  set brief_master_arm arm
  set brief_release_s 25
  wp 46.90000 7.60000 8000 420

unit fulcrum
  team hostile
  module mig29
  spawn 46.90000 7.10000 8000 270.0 420
  set gear up
  set fuel_pct 70
  set n019_mode cc
  set n019_range_nm 40
  set n019_emission illum
  set store 3 r27r
  set store 4 r73
  set rwr on
  set brief_master_arm arm
  set brief_release_s 25
  wp 46.90000 6.30000 8000 420
